# The application's own configuration.
#
# The previous tree carried the wireless-bench and netio instrument knobs here
# (WLAN_*, NETIO_*, the lwIP window knobs).  This line imports neither, so the
# menu keeps the one symbol every image needs - the case list - and the place
# for a knob a future case brings with it.

menu "Application"

config CASES
	string "Case groups (space-separated)"
	default ""
	help
	  The case groups this image carries, in run order.  Each name is one
	  translation unit under app/cases/ and one entry in the runner's table;
	  the build derives the case's RTOS_CASE_* macro from this string, so the
	  source set, the table and the judge's expectations are the same fact.

config AP_WPA2
	bool "iwl7260_ap runs the WPA2-PSK/CCMP variant"
	help
	  Only changes the AP case (and the hostapd configuration it applies):
	  the passphrase, the 4-way wait and the PASS APW gate.  The hostap
	  source set, the driver table and the image's other cases are the same
	  as the open AP profile.  Used by rk3568-iwl7260-ap-wpa2.

endmenu
